                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} filt_s \Omega^\bullet(U \times \Delta^k)
                %p
                  for the sub-simplicial set of differential forms that vanish when evaluated on more than
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
